73
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:47,940
Now that does raise a better question,

74
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:49,900
which is, do the markets still work well

75
00:02:49,900 --> 00:02:51,700
when the stakes are so limited?

76
00:02:51,700 --> 00:02:53,320
And there's a lot of experimental work on this,

77
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:56,140
finding that while they don't work quite as well,

78
00:02:56,140 --> 00:02:57,120
they still work quite well.

79
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:59,460
Just having even modest cash sums

80
00:02:59,460 --> 00:03:01,020
